<html>span.text1865961Font1 { font-size:21px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1865961Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865961Font1&quot;  &gt;Clinical Concept&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865961Font2&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\cf2\fs32\b Clinical Concept\plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Clinical Concept</raw>
<numoflines>1</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
<text id="1865962" parent="1865956" visible="false" ontop="true" fixed="true" proportional="false" defaulttext="none">
<name>ann_text</name>
<lastupdated>1769453148</lastupdated>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>197</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>624</cx>
<cy>139</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1865962Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text1865962Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1865962Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#0000ff; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;}&#x0A;span.text1865962Font4 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:11px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865962Font1&quot;  &gt;Patients also should be fitted with a splint to be used at bedtime for up to 4 months and provided with instructions on how to use it. In addition, clinicians should teach patients how to perform finger extension and flexion exercises and instruct them to perform these exercises several times a day for several months. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:11px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865962Font2&quot;  &gt;Please view the video clip on the finger extension and flexion exercises &lt;/span &gt;&lt;a href=&quot;##Action 1865963&quot;  &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865962Font3&quot;  &gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865962Font4&quot;  &gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1865962Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Normal;}{\cs1\cf3\cb1\ulc3 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf3\cb1\ulc3 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf3\cb1\ulc3\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f2\cf3\cb1\ulc3 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\sa160\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Patients also should be fitted with a splint to be used at bedtime for up to 4 months and provided with instructions on how to use it. In addition, clinicians should teach patients how to perform &#x0A;finger extension and flexion exercises and instruct them to perform these exercises several times a day for several months. \plain\f1\fs24\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\b Please view the video clip on the finger extension and flexion exercises\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 &#x0A; \cf2\sshlink\ul{\field{\fldinst HYPERLINK &quot;##Action 1865963&quot;}{\fldrslt here}}\cf0\sshlink0\ul0 .  \plain\f1\fs24\par\sa120\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Patients also should be fitted with a splint to be used at bedtime for up to 4 months and provided with instructions on how to use it. In addition, clinicians should teach patients how to perform finger extension and flexion exercises and instruct them to perform these exercises several times a day for several months. &#x0A;Please view the video clip on the finger extension and flexion exercises here.  &#x0A;</raw>
<numoflines>6</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
