<html>span.text1889861Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1889861Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot;  &gt;In the same patient, tendon rupture after collagenase injection was observed in the following pictures below. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ol  start=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;padding-left:10px;list-style-type:upper-alpha;margin-left:25px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot;  &gt;The left panel shows extensive inflammation seen in the soft tissue upon opening of the site of injection. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;padding-left:10px;list-style-type:upper-alpha;margin-left:25px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1889861Font1&quot;  &gt;The right panel shows further damage at the injection site. Surgery to explore the injection site showed loss of both flexor digitorum profundus and flexor digitorum superficialis, with inflammation and disruption to the flexor tendon sheath. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ol &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f3 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;{\*\listtable&#x0A;{\list\listtemplateid1&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc3\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;00.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc4\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;01.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc0\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;02.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc1\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;03.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc2\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;04.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc3\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;05.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc4\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;06.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc0\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;07.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc1\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;02\&apos;08.}{\levelnumbers \&apos;01}}&#x0A;{\listname DefaultList;}\listid1769548222&#x0A;}&#x0A;}&#x0A;{\*\listoverridetable&#x0A;{\listoverride\listid1769548222\listoverridecount0\ls1}&#x0A;}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql In the same patient, tendon rupture after collagenase injection was observed in the following pictures below. \par\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\par\plain\f1\fs24\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1\par\plain\f1\fs24\par\par\par\pard\s0{\pntext\pard\plain\f1\fs24 &#x0A;A.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnstart1\ls1\ilvl0\pnhang{\pntxta \&apos;2e}}\ls1\ilvl0\fi-510\li510\sa120\ql The left panel shows extensive inflammation seen in the soft tissue upon opening of the site of injection.  \par\sa0 The right panel shows further damage &#x0A;at the injection site. Surgery to explore the injection site showed loss of both flexor digitorum profundus and flexor digitorum superficialis, with inflammation and disruption to the flexor tendon sheath.  \par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿In the same patient, tendon rupture after collagenase injection was observed in the following pictures below. &#x0D;&#x0D;&#x0D;&#x0D;&#x0D;&#x0D;&#x0A;The left panel shows extensive inflammation seen in the soft tissue upon opening of the site of injection.  &#x0A;The right panel shows further damage at the injection site. Surgery to explore the injection site showed loss of both flexor digitorum profundus and flexor digitorum superficialis, with inflammation and disruption to the flexor tendon sheath.  </raw>
<numoflines>14</numoflines>
