<html>span.text1806162Font1 { font-size:21px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#000000; font-weight:bold;}&#x0A;span.text1806162Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806162Font1&quot;  &gt;Safety Note&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806162Font2&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\cf2\fs32\b Safety Note\plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Safety Note</raw>
<numoflines>1</numoflines>
<numpubbullets>0</numpubbullets>
<textpublishlang>Inherit</textpublishlang>
<marginsize>0</marginsize>
</text>
<text id="1806163" parent="1806157" visible="false" ontop="true" fixed="true" proportional="false" publishasimage="true" defaulttext="none">
<name>ann_text</name>
<lastupdated>1769448263</lastupdated>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>213</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>607</cx>
<cy>145</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1806163Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1806163Font1&quot;  &gt;In addition to the warnings concerning tendon rupture, other serious adverse events can occur with XIAFLEX, as noted in this paragraph. An example of a skin tear after finger extension is shown below. Postmarketing cases of skin laceration requiring skin graft after finger extension procedures and local skin and soft-tissue necrosis, some requiring skin grafting or other surgical interventions, including finger amputation, have been reported. It is noted that signs or symptoms that may reflect serious injury to the injected finger/hand should be promptly evaluated because surgical intervention may be required. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 In addition to the warnings concerning tendon rupture, other serious adverse events can occur with XIAFLEX, as noted in this paragraph. An example of a skin tear after finger extension is shown below. Postmarketing &#x0A;cases of skin laceration requiring skin graft after finger extension procedures and local skin and soft-tissue necrosis, some requiring skin grafting or other surgical interventions, including finger amputation, have been reported. It is noted that signs &#x0A;or symptoms that may reflect serious injury to the injected finger/hand should be promptly evaluated because surgical intervention may be required. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿In addition to the warnings concerning tendon rupture, other serious adverse events can occur with XIAFLEX, as noted in this paragraph. An example of a skin tear after finger extension is shown below. Postmarketing cases of skin laceration requiring skin graft after finger extension procedures and local skin and soft-tissue necrosis, some requiring skin grafting or other surgical interventions, including finger amputation, have been reported. It is noted that signs or symptoms that may reflect serious injury to the injected finger/hand should be promptly evaluated because surgical intervention may be required. </raw>
<numoflines>8</numoflines>
