<text id="1871159" parent="1871153" visible="false" ontop="true" fixed="true" proportional="false" publishasimage="true" defaulttext="none">
<name>ann_text</name>
<lastupdated>1769707438</lastupdated>
<respprops>
<tabletportrait>
<text>
<possize>
<size>
<cx>464</cx>
<cy>266</cy>
</size>
<point>
<x>162</x>
<y>208</y>
</point>
</possize>
</text>
</tabletportrait>
</respprops>
<possize>
<point>
<x>212</x>
<y>213</y>
</point>
<size>
<cx>623</cx>
<cy>224</cy>
</size>
</possize>
<cssclasses>hideMe a_text</cssclasses>
<opacity>100</opacity>
<html>span.text1871159Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1871159Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot;  &gt;In the placebo-controlled portions of CORD I and CORD II through Day 90: &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1871159SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot;  &gt;98% of XIAFLEX-treated and 51% of placebo-treated patients had an adverse reaction after up to 3 injections &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1871159SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot;  &gt;Over 95% of XIAFLEX-treated patients had an adverse reaction of the injected extremity after up to 3 injections; approximately 81% of these local reactions resolved without intervention within 4 weeks of injections &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1871159SquareBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot;  &gt;The adverse reaction profile was similar for each injection, regardless of the number of injections administered &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1871159Font1&quot;  &gt;The incidence of pruritus increased with the number of injections. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\sa120\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 In the placebo-controlled portions of CORD I and CORD II through Day 90: \plain\f1\fs24\par\pard\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li360\sa120\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 98% of &#x0A;XIAFLEX-treated and 51% of placebo-treated patients had an adverse reaction after up to 3 injections \plain\f1\fs24\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Over 95% of XIAFLEX-treated patients had an adverse reaction of the injected extremity after up to 3 injections; &#x0A;approximately 81% of these local reactions resolved without intervention within 4 weeks of injections \plain\f1\fs24\par\pard\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li360\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 The adverse reaction profile was similar &#x0A;for each injection, regardless of the number of injections administered \par\pard\s0\ql\plain\f1\fs24\par\sa120\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 The incidence of pruritus increased with the number of injections. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿In the placebo-controlled portions of CORD I and CORD II through Day 90: &#x0A;98% of XIAFLEX-treated and 51% of placebo-treated patients had an adverse reaction after up to 3 injections &#x0A;Over 95% of XIAFLEX-treated patients had an adverse reaction of the injected extremity after up to 3 injections; approximately 81% of these local reactions resolved without intervention within 4 weeks of injections &#x0A;The adverse reaction profile was similar for each injection, regardless of the number of injections administered &#x0A;The incidence of pruritus increased with the number of injections. </raw>
<publishedbullets>
