<html>span.text1808343Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1808343Font1&quot;  &gt;No overall differences in safety or effectiveness of XIAFLEX were observed between older patients and younger patients in Studies 1 and 2. Of the 249 XIAFLEX-treated patients in Studies 1 and 2, 42% were â‰¥65 years of age and 9% were â‰¥75 years of age. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 No overall differences in safety or effectiveness of XIAFLEX were observed between older patients and younger patients in Studies 1 and 2. Of the 249 XIAFLEX-treated patients in Studies 1 and 2, 42% were \u8805 &#x0A;\&apos;3f65 years of age and 9% were \u8805 \&apos;3f75 years of age. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿No overall differences in safety or effectiveness of XIAFLEX were observed between older patients and younger patients in Studies 1 and 2. Of the 249 XIAFLEX-treated patients in Studies 1 and 2, 42% were ≥65 years of age and 9% were ≥75 years of age. </raw>
