<html>span.text1878801Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1878801Font1&quot;  &gt;XIAFLEX 0.58 mg was studied in CORD I and CORD II (Study 1 and Study 2, respectively): 2 randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled pivotal trials in 374 adult patients with Dupuytren&apos;s contracture. The primary endpoint was the percentage of patients achieving a reduction in contracture of the selected primary jointâ€”MP or PIPâ€”to within 0Â° to 5Â° of normal, 30 days after the last injection of that joint on Days 30, 60, or 90 (after up to 3 injections). &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1878801Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1878801Font1&quot;  &gt;Key inclusion and exclusion criteria are summarized in the table below. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 XIAFLEX 0.58 mg was studied in CORD I and CORD II (Study 1 and Study 2, respectively): 2 randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled pivotal trials in 374 adult patients with Dupuytren&apos;s contracture. The &#x0A;primary endpoint was the percentage of patients achieving a reduction in contracture of the selected primary joint\u8212 \&apos;97MP or PIP\u8212 \&apos;97to within 0\u176 \&apos;b0 to 5\u176 \&apos;b0 of normal, 30 days after the last injection of that joint on Days 30, &#x0A;60, or 90 (after up to 3 injections). \plain\f1\fs24\par\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Key inclusion and exclusion criteria are summarized in the table below. \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿XIAFLEX 0.58 mg was studied in CORD I and CORD II (Study 1 and Study 2, respectively): 2 randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled pivotal trials in 374 adult patients with Dupuytren&apos;s contracture. The primary endpoint was the percentage of patients achieving a reduction in contracture of the selected primary joint—MP or PIP—to within 0° to 5° of normal, 30 days after the last injection of that joint on Days 30, 60, or 90 (after up to 3 injections). &#x0A;Key inclusion and exclusion criteria are summarized in the table below. </raw>
