<html>span.text1891079Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1891079Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;span.text1891079Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;li.text1891079Font2 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-decoration:normal;}&#x0A;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse; border-spacing:0&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;tr style=&quot;vertical-align:top&quot;  &gt;&#x0A;&lt;td  style=&quot;width:292px;height:22px; border-style:solid;border-left-color:#000000;border-left-width:1px;border-right-color:#000000;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:#000000; border-top-width:1px;border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-width:1px;padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;vertical-align:top;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font1&quot;  &gt;Inclusion criteria &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/td &gt;&#x0A;&lt;td  style=&quot;width:286px;height:22px; border-style:solid;border-left-color:#000000;border-left-width:1px;border-right-color:#000000;border-right-width:1px;border-top-color:#000000; border-top-width:1px;border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-width:1px;padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;vertical-align:top;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font1&quot;  &gt;Exclusion criteria &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/td &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/tr &gt;&#x0A;&lt;tr style=&quot;vertical-align:top&quot;  &gt;&#x0A;&lt;td  style=&quot;width:292px;height:165px; border-style:solid;border-left-color:#000000;border-left-width:1px;border-right-color:#000000;border-right-width:0px;border-top-color:#000000; border-top-width:0px;border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-width:1px;padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;vertical-align:top;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;At study entry, patients must have had: &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079CircleBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;Flexion contracture with a palpable cord in â‰¥1 finger (other than the thumb) &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079SquareBulletFont8.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;MP joint contractures 20Â° to 100Â° &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079SquareBulletFont8.png&apos;); padding-left:7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;PIP joint contractures 20Â° to 80Â° &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079CircleBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;Positive &quot;table top test&quot; &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/td &gt;&#x0A;&lt;td  style=&quot;width:286px;height:165px; border-style:solid;border-left-color:#000000;border-left-width:1px;border-right-color:#000000;border-right-width:1px;border-top-color:#000000; border-top-width:0px;border-bottom-color:#000000; border-bottom-width:1px;padding-left:3px;padding-right:3px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;vertical-align:top;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;At study entry, patients could not have received: &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;ul  style=&quot;list-style-position:outside;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:8px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079CircleBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;A surgical treatment on the selected primary joint â‰¤90 days before the first injection &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;li  class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot; data-bltIndnt=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.127;position:relative;margin-left:15px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; list-style-image:url(&apos;images/text1891079CircleBulletFont7.png&apos;); padding-left:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;!--{ &#x0A;data-bltIndnt:0&#x0A;} --&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891079Font2&quot;  &gt;Anticoagulant medication â‰¤7 days before the first injection (except for â‰¤150 mg of aspirin per day) &lt;/span &gt;&lt;/li &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:2px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/ul &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/td &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/tr &gt;&#x0A;&lt;/table &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f3 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24&#x0A;\trowd\trgaph60\trleft0&#x0A;\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clcbpat1\cellx4500&#x0A;\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw15\brdrcf2\clcbpat1\cellx8910&#x0A;\pard\intbl\s0\ql\b Inclusion criteria \plain\f1\fs24\cell&#x0A;\pard\intbl\s0\ql\b Exclusion criteria \plain\f1\fs24\cell&#x0A;\intbl\row&#x0A;\pard\intbl\s0\sa120\ql At study entry, patients must have had: \par\pard\intbl\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;b7}}\fi-360\li360\sa120\ql Flexion contracture with a palpable cord in \plain\f1\fs24\u8805 \&apos;3f\plain\f1\fs24 1 finger (other than &#x0A;the thumb) \par\pard\intbl\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf3{\pntxtb \&apos;a7}}\fi-360\li720\ql MP joint contractures 20\plain\f1\fs24\u176 \&apos;b0\plain\f1\fs24  to 100\plain\f1\fs24\u176 \&apos;b0\plain\f1\fs24  \par PIP joint contractures 20\plain\f1\fs24\u176 \&apos;b0\plain\f1\fs24 &#x0A; to 80\plain\f1\fs24\u176 \&apos;b0\plain\f1\fs24  \par\pard\intbl\s0\ql\par\pard\intbl\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;b7}}\fi-360\li360\ql Positive &quot;table top test&quot; \cell&#x0A;\pard\intbl\s0\sa120\ql At study entry, patients could not have received: \par\pard\intbl\s0{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnhang\pnf2{\pntxtb \&apos;b7}}\fi-360\li360\sa120\ql A surgical treatment on the selected primary joint \plain\f1\fs24\u8804 \&apos;3f\plain\f1\fs24 90 &#x0A;days before the first injection \par\sa0 Anticoagulant medication \plain\f1\fs24\u8804 \&apos;3f\plain\f1\fs24 7 days before the first injection (except for \plain\f1\fs24\u8804 \&apos;3f\plain\f1\fs24 150 mg of aspirin per day) \cell&#x0A;\intbl\row&#x0A;\pard\s0\ql\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Inclusion criteria &#x09;Exclusion criteria &#x09;&#x0A;At study entry, patients must have had: &#x0A;Flexion contracture with a palpable cord in ≥1 finger (other than the thumb) &#x0A;MP joint contractures 20° to 100° &#x0A;PIP joint contractures 20° to 80° &#x0A;Positive &quot;table top test&quot; &#x09;At study entry, patients could not have received: &#x0A;A surgical treatment on the selected primary joint ≤90 days before the first injection &#x0A;Anticoagulant medication ≤7 days before the first injection (except for ≤150 mg of aspirin per day) &#x09;&#x0A;</raw>
