<html>span.text1878765Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1878765Font1&quot;  &gt;Patients were not allowed to enroll if they had had surgical treatment, such as fasciectomy or fasciotomy, within 90 days of the first injection. Several approaches to fasciotomy or fasciectomy may be considered based on the pattern and severity of disease. These are provided below: &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\sa120 +NXL_Table_Bullet;}{\cs4\f2\cf2\cb1\ulc2 +NXL_Table_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 Patients were not allowed to enroll if they had had surgical treatment, such as fasciectomy or fasciotomy, within 90 days of the first injection. Several approaches to fasciotomy or fasciectomy may be considered &#x0A;based on the pattern and severity of disease. These are provided below:  \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿Patients were not allowed to enroll if they had had surgical treatment, such as fasciectomy or fasciotomy, within 90 days of the first injection. Several approaches to fasciotomy or fasciectomy may be considered based on the pattern and severity of disease. These are provided below:  </raw>
