<html>span.text1891963Font1 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891963Font1&quot;  &gt;As described in the Warnings and Precautions section, tendon rupture is a serious adverse event that can occur with XIAFLEX treatment. Examples of tendon rupture and the clinical effects are shown below. &#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891963Font1&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text1891963Font1&quot;  &gt;The following image shows loss of active motion at the PIP and DIP joints after the third collagenase injection into the left small finger. &amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 As described in the Warnings and Precautions section, tendon rupture is a serious adverse event that can occur with XIAFLEX treatment. Examples of tendon rupture and the clinical effects are shown below. \plain\f1\fs24\par\par\lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 &#x0A;The following image shows loss of active motion at the PIP and DIP joints after the third collagenase injection into the left small finger.  \plain\f1\fs24\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿As described in the Warnings and Precautions section, tendon rupture is a serious adverse event that can occur with XIAFLEX treatment. Examples of tendon rupture and the clinical effects are shown below. &#x0A;The following image shows loss of active motion at the PIP and DIP joints after the third collagenase injection into the left small finger.  </raw>
