<html>span.text164335Font3 { font-size:16px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;span.text164335Font4 { font-size:12px; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;, sans-serif; color:#010101;}&#x0A;&lt;p  legLH=&quot;1.127&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:0px;text-indent:0px;line-height:1.080;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:left;&quot; &gt;&#x0A;&lt;span class=&quot;text164335Font3&quot;  &gt;The XIAFLEX&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text164335Font4&quot;  &gt;&lt;sup &gt;Â®&lt;/sup &gt;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text164335Font3&quot;  &gt; (collagenase clostridium histolyticum) for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture PI Explorer is intended to increase your understanding of XIAFLEX for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture by presenting in-depth information within the full XIAFLEX Prescribing Information (PI). The information within this PI Explorer should be used in compliant conversations with healthcare providers (HCPs) and their offices. This training tool is for internal use only.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This guide is not intended to represent the full extent of the information you should know from the PI. It is important that you read through the PI completely. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&#x0A;&lt;/span &gt;&lt;/p &gt;&#x0A;</html>
<rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\deflang1033\ftnbj\uc1\deff1&#x0A;{\fonttbl{\f0 \froman \fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 \fswiss Arial;}{\f2 \fnil \fcharset2 Wingdings;}{\f3 \froman \fcharset2 Symbol;}{\f4 \fnil Verdana;}}&#x0A;{\colortbl\red0\green0\blue0 ;\red255\green255\blue255 ;\red0\green0\blue0 ;}&#x0A;{\stylesheet{\f1\fs24\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Normal;}{\cs1\cf2\cb1\ulc2 Default Paragraph Font;}{\s2\snext0\cf2\cb1\ulc2 ;}{\s3\snext3\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\sa60 &gt;NXL_Normal;}{\cs4\f4\cf2\cb1\ulc2 &gt;NXL_Normal Char;}{\s5\snext5\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\tx360\fi-360\li360\sa80 &#x0A;`NXL_Bullet;}{\s6\snext5\fs20\cf2\cb1\ulc2\tx360\sa80 `NXL_Bullet_2;}{\cs7\f4\cf2\cb1\ulc2 `NXL_Bullet Char;}}&#x0A;{\*\revtbl{Unknown;}}&#x0A;{\*\listtable&#x0A;{\list\listtemplateid1515899650&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01-}{\levelnumbers}\f3\fs24}&#x0A;{\listlevel\levelnfc23\levelfollow0\levelstartat1{\leveltext \&apos;01\&apos;a7}{\levelnumbers}\f2\fs24}&#x0A;{\listname ;}\listid285888238&#x0A;}&#x0A;}&#x0A;{\*\listoverridetable}&#x0A;\paperw12240\paperh15840\margl1800\margr1800\margt1440\margb1440\headery720\footery720\deftab360\formshade\aendnotes\aftnnrlc\pgbrdrhead\pgbrdrfoot&#x0A;\sectd\pgwsxn12240\pghsxn15840\marglsxn1800\margrsxn1800\margtsxn1440\margbsxn1440\headery720\footery720\sbkpage\pgncont\pgndec&#x0A;\plain\plain\f1\fs24\ql The XIAFLEX{\super\u174 \&apos;ae} \lang1033\hich\f1\loch\f1 (collagenase clostridium histolyticum) for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture PI Explorer is intended to increase your understanding of XIAFLEX for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture by presenting &#x0A;in-depth information within the full XIAFLEX Prescribing Information (PI). The information within this PI Explorer should be used in compliant conversations with healthcare providers (HCPs) and their offices. This training tool is for internal use only.\plain\f1\fs24\line\line &#x0A;This guide is not intended to represent the full extent of the information you should know from the PI. It is important that you read through the PI completely.   \par\cf2\ulc2\par}&#x0A;</rtf>
<raw>﻿The XIAFLEX® (collagenase clostridium histolyticum) for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture PI Explorer is intended to increase your understanding of XIAFLEX for Dupuytren&apos;s contracture by presenting in-depth information within the full XIAFLEX Prescribing Information (PI). The information within this PI Explorer should be used in compliant conversations with healthcare providers (HCPs) and their offices. This training tool is for internal use only.&#x0F;&#x0F;This guide is not intended to represent the full extent of the information you should know from the PI. It is important that you read through the PI completely.   &#x0A;</raw>
